{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_0173zx6tSKVYKFvvbG8E38yC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_vrtx_01S66tJVUfjJrRjqnG3Y2TRb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add ai-engineering/answers/03-026-control-cost-explosions-from-tool-calls.md ai-engineering/plan.md ai-engineering/progress.txt && git commit -m \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nfeat(ai-eng): 03-agents-tool-use — Q26 control cost explosions from tool calls\n\n6-layer cost-control framework: orchestrator hard limits (max_turns/token-cap/\nwall-clock in code), context compression (sliding window + cheap summarization),\nmodel tiering (GPT-4o-mini for routine steps, GPT-4o for synthesis), tool-call\ncaching + deduplication, narrow tool schemas, HITL gate for expensive branches.\nCost math: naive $250K/day → tiered+cached $8K/day at 1M queries/day.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit Q26 answer note and plan update"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":258,"cache_read_input_tokens":67831,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":258,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8694a335-8310-4e20-9646-f7b767b5287f","uuid":"510b9691-b69e-44b3-926b-77fb6bf853e0"}
